display_name = "Raise Slab"
description = "A 2.4 m wide stone pillar rises 3 m out of the ground where you aim (within 18 m) in half a second and stands for 5 s (450 hp). Anyone on it rides up: an elevator for allies, a lift into the open for enemies. Blocks shots and movement."
